WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.640
Mr Saeed: Hello! Welcome to English Path. Unit one, lesson three. Everyday English.

2
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.614
Ali: Good morning, Fahad!

3
00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:15.601
Fahad: Good morning, Ali!

4
00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.136
Ali: Have a nice day, Fahad!

5
00:00:18.136 --> 00:00:21.494
Mr Saeed: Good morning, boys! Have a nice day!

6
00:00:21.494 --> 00:00:23.280
Fahad: Thank you, Mr Saeed.

7
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.436
Fahad: Good afternoon! A cup of tea, please.

8
00:00:30.436 --> 00:00:33.167
Ali: With milk and sugar?

9
00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:36.179
Fahad: Milk, please. No sugar, thanks.

10
00:00:36.179 --> 00:00:38.009
Ali: Here you are.

11
00:00:38.009 --> 00:00:39.649
Fahad: Thank you.

12
00:00:39.649 --> 00:00:43.768
Sara: I'm thirsty. A glass of water, please.

13
00:00:43.768 --> 00:00:46.150
Ali: Here you are, Sara.

14
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.669
Sara: Thank you!

15
00:00:51.569 --> 00:00:54.705
Ali: Goodbye, everyone! See you later!

16
00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:57.825
Sara: Good night, Fahad. Sleep well!

17
00:00:57.825 --> 00:00:59.691
Fahad: Good night, Sara.

18
00:01:03.191 --> 00:01:05.912
Mr Saeed: Let's learn some new words.

19
00:01:05.912 --> 00:01:07.252
Mr Saeed: Water.

20
00:01:07.252 --> 00:01:08.678
Mr Saeed: Milk.

21
00:01:08.678 --> 00:01:10.229
Mr Saeed: Juice.

22
00:01:10.229 --> 00:01:11.685
Mr Saeed: Glass.

23
00:01:11.685 --> 00:01:13.146
Mr Saeed: Sugar.

24
00:01:13.146 --> 00:01:14.755
Mr Saeed: Biscuit.

25
00:01:14.755 --> 00:01:16.090
Mr Saeed: Cake.

26
00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.755
Mr Saeed: Hungry. You want to eat.

27
00:01:18.755 --> 00:01:21.103
Mr Saeed: Thirsty. You want to drink.

28
00:01:23.503 --> 00:01:29.440
Mr Saeed: Let's look at everyday English. We say different things at different times.

29
00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:33.075
Mr Saeed: Before twelve o'clock, we say good morning.

30
00:01:33.075 --> 00:01:36.826
Mr Saeed: After twelve o'clock, we say good afternoon.

31
00:01:36.826 --> 00:01:41.386
Mr Saeed: After five o'clock, in the evening, we say good evening.

32
00:01:41.386 --> 00:01:44.450
Mr Saeed: Before bed, we say good night.

33
00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:48.043
Mr Saeed: When you leave, say goodbye, or, see you later.

34
00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:54.651
Mr Saeed: We also say nice things when we leave.

35
00:01:54.651 --> 00:01:57.003
Mr Saeed: Have a nice day!

36
00:01:57.003 --> 00:01:58.957
Mr Saeed: See you later!

37
00:01:58.957 --> 00:02:00.556
Mr Saeed: Sleep well!

38
00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:07.633
Mr Saeed: Be polite. Use these words every day.

39
00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:10.974
Mr Saeed: Please. Use it when you ask.

40
00:02:10.974 --> 00:02:14.655
Mr Saeed: Thank you. Use it when you get something.

41
00:02:14.655 --> 00:02:17.650
Mr Saeed: Here you are. Use it when you give something.

42
00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.985
Mr Saeed: Now, opposites.

43
00:02:22.985 --> 00:02:25.448
Mr Saeed: Day. Night.

44
00:02:25.448 --> 00:02:27.923
Mr Saeed: Good. Bad.

45
00:02:27.923 --> 00:02:29.787
Mr Saeed: With. Without.

46
00:02:32.587 --> 00:02:37.398
Mr Saeed: We say a cup of, a glass of, or a piece of.

47
00:02:37.398 --> 00:02:39.453
Mr Saeed: A cup of tea.

48
00:02:39.453 --> 00:02:41.644
Mr Saeed: A glass of water.

49
00:02:41.644 --> 00:02:43.209
Mr Saeed: A piece of cake.

50
00:02:46.009 --> 00:02:48.632
Mr Saeed: Now listen and repeat.

51
00:02:48.632 --> 00:02:51.049
Mr Saeed: Good morning!

52
00:02:52.749 --> 00:02:55.694
Mr Saeed: Good afternoon!

53
00:02:57.394 --> 00:02:59.998
Mr Saeed: Good evening!

54
00:03:01.698 --> 00:03:04.254
Mr Saeed: Good night!

55
00:03:05.954 --> 00:03:08.508
Mr Saeed: See you later!

56
00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:13.383
Mr Saeed: A cup of tea, please.

57
00:03:15.483 --> 00:03:16.867
Mr Saeed: Here you are.

58
00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:25.000
Mr Saeed: Quick quiz! Choose the right word.

59
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:31.701
Mr Saeed: Good, blank. It's eight in the morning. Morning, or night?

60
00:03:34.001 --> 00:03:35.865
Fahad: Good morning!

61
00:03:35.865 --> 00:03:41.168
Mr Saeed: A cup of tea, blank. Please, or sorry?

62
00:03:43.468 --> 00:03:45.977
Sara: A cup of tea, please.

63
00:03:45.977 --> 00:03:51.634
Mr Saeed: A glass, blank, water, please. Of, or at?

64
00:03:53.934 --> 00:03:55.896
Ali: A glass of water.

65
00:03:58.296 --> 00:04:02.050
Mr Saeed: Now it's your turn. Say good morning to your teacher.

66
00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.396
Mr Saeed: Well done! See you in the next lesson.
